  "description": {
    "raw": "You take on an aspect of a falcon. Your eyes become wide and raptor-like, and you grow feathers on the sides of your head. You gain a +3 competence bonus on Perception checks, a +1 competence bonus on ranged attacks, and the critical multiplier for your bows and crossbows becomes 19–20/×3. This effect does not stack with any other effect that expands the threat range of a weapon, such as the Improved Critical feat or a keen weapon.",
    "search_text": "\"you take on an aspect of a falcon. your eyes become wide and raptor-like, and you grow feathers on the sides of your head. you gain a +3 competence bonus on perception checks, a +1 competence bonus on ranged attacks, and the critical multiplier for your bows and crossbows becomes 19–20/×3. this effect does not stack with any other effect that expands the threat range of a weapon, such as the improved critical feat or a keen weapon.\"",
